OL,3,ABBC DJ Trevor Nelson reveals brain
OL,4,Atumour surgery 'went well'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC DJ and presenter Trevor Nelson has
OL,7,Frevealed he stepped away from work
OL,8,Fafter being diagnosed with a brain
OL,9,Ftumour.
OL,11,FNelson was last on air in June and had
OL,12,Fannounced he was "taking a little break
OL,13,Ffrom my work commitments" due to
OL,14,F"health issues".
OL,16,FSpeaking to his Instagram followers,
OL,17,Fexternal, the 62-year-old said that his
OL,18,F"world was turned upside down" when a
OL,19,Fbrain tumour was discovered.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
